that fits the visual tone of your context."},"1651":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-21","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#sizes","content":"Choose a size that fits the surrounding content. Smaller tags work well in compact layouts like tables; larger tags suit headings or hero sections."},"1652":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-22","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#inline","content":"Use `design=\"inline\"` to embed a tag within a sentence. The background and border are removed so the tag blends into the text flow."},"1653":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-23","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#high-contrast","content":"A bolder color treatment for when tags need to stand out more - for example, on colored backgrounds."},"1654":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-24","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#with-icon","content":"Icons reinforce the tag's meaning at a glance. Add an `Icon` as a child - it inherits the tag's color and scales with its size."},"1655":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-25","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#indicator","content":"A minimal style that pairs a small colored dot with a neutral background. Well suited for dense layouts like tables or dashboards where multiple tags in close proximity would otherwise compete for attention."},"1656":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-26","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#screen-readers","content":"Tags are `<span>` elements with no special ARIA role. Screen readers announce the tag's text as part of normal page content — no extra markup is needed."},"1657":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-27","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#decorative-icons","content":"Icons passed as children must include `aria-hidden=\"true\"` so they are skipped by screen readers. The text label is the sole carrier of meaning."},"1658":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-28","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#indicator-dot","content":"The colored dot is decorative and invisible to screen readers. The text label must convey the status on its own — never rely on the dot alone to communicate meaning."},"1659":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-29","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#best-practices","content":"Use the indicator style in dense layouts like tables and dashboards. Use the filled style when the tag is a prominent, standalone element on a card or hero section."},"1660":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-30","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#best-practices","content":"Default to the small size in compact layouts like tables and lists. Use medium or large only when the tag needs to stand out as a primary piece of information."},"1661":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-31","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#best-practices","content":"Use the inline design only within running prose. In grouped or standalone contexts, the filled style provides better visual separation."},"1662":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-32","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#best-practices","content":"Do not stack multiple tags of different emphasis on the same item. Choose the most important one — too many competing labels lose their meaning."},"1663":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-33","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#when-to-use","content":"Showing the status of an item on a card, table row, or list entry (e.g. \"Active\", \"Expired\", \"Pending\")"},"1664":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-34","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#when-to-use","content":"Categorizing or grouping content so users can scan and filter quickly (e.g. \"New\", \"Sale\", \"Beta\")"},"1665":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-35","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#when-to-use","content":"Surfacing metadata about an item (e.g. \"Pro\", \"Free trial\", \"Internal\")"},"1666":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-36","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#when-to-use","content":"Communicating priority or category in project management and collaboration tools (e.g. \"High priority\", \"In review\")"},"1667":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-37","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#when-not-to-use","content":"If users need to click or dismiss it — use a **Button** instead."},"1668":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-38","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#when-not-to-use","content":"If the label is part of a sentence with no visual distinction — just use text."},"1669":{"id":"/docs/components/text","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"page","content":"Text","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text"},"1670":{"id":"/docs/components/text-0","page_id":"/docs/components/text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text","content":"Body copy and supporting detail, with size, emphasis, alignment, and truncation options"},"1671":{"id":"/docs/components/text-1","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#features","content":"Features"},"1672":{"id":"/docs/components/text-2","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#installation","content":"Installation"},"1673":{"id":"/docs/components/text-3","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#examples","content":"Examples"},"1674":{"id":"/docs/components/text-4","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#default","content":"Default"},"1675":{"id":"/docs/components/text-5","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#as","content":"As"},"1676":{"id":"/docs/components/text-6","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#align","content":"Align"},"1677":{"id":"/docs/components/text-7","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#max-lines","content":"Max Lines"},"1678":{"id":"/docs/components/text-8","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#wrap","content":"Wrap"},"1679":{"id":"/docs/components/text-9","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#sizes","content":"Sizes"},"1680":{"id":"/docs/components/text-10","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#emphasis","content":"Emphasis"},"1681":{"id":"/docs/components/text-11","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#detail","content":"Detail"},"1682":{"id":"/docs/components/text-12","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#props","content":"Props"},"1683":{"id":"/docs/components/text-13","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#text","content":"Text"},"1684":{"id":"/docs/components/text-14","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#detail-1","content":"Detail"},"1685":{"id":"/docs/components/text-15","page_id":"/docs/components/text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text","content":"`Text` is body copy and `Detail` is supporting copy: captions, metadata, and hints."},"1686":{"id":"/docs/components/text-16","page_id":"/docs/components/text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text#features","content":"`Text` applies the body role and `Detail` the detail role, each at the tier of the nearest\n`SizeProvider`, or `md` outside any scope."},"1687":{"id":"/docs/components/text-17","page_id":"/docs/components/text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text#features","content":"Inside a component's named part, such as a field description or a lockup body, the part sets the\ntreatment. Inside a control, the label keeps the control's type, so\n`<Button><Text>Save</Text></Button>` looks exactly like `<Button>Save</Button>`."},"1688":{"id":"/docs/components/text-18","page_id":"/docs/components/text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text#features","content":"`size` picks a step on the component's own ramp (`xs` to `2xl`) and changes only the font size."},"1689":{"id":"/docs/components/text-19","page_id":"/docs/components/text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text#features","content":"`emphasis` picks a feedback color and changes only the color."},"1690":{"id":"/docs/components/text-20","page_id":"/docs/components/text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text#features","content":"For semantic emphasis, render `as=\"strong\"` or `as=\"em\"`."},"1691":{"id":"/docs/components/text-21","page_id":"/docs/components/text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text#default","content":"Basic text content."},"1692":{"id":"/docs/components/text-22","page_id":"/docs/components/text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text#as","content":"Setting the `as` prop allows you to change the HTML tag of the `Text` component."},"1693":{"id":"/docs/components/text-23","page_id":"/docs/components/text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text#align","content":"Setting the `align` prop allows you to change the alignment of the text. Choose from `start`, `center`, `end`, or `justify`; the logical keywords support RTL languages."},"1694":{"id":"/docs/components/text-24","page_id":"/docs/components/text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text#max-lines","content":"Setting the `maxLines` prop limits the number of displayed lines using an ellipsis."},"1695":{"id":"/docs/components/text-25","page_id":"/docs/components/text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text#wrap","content":"Setting the `wrap` prop controls text wrapping with values such as `wrap`, `nowrap`, `balance`, `pretty`, or `stable`."},"1696":{"id":"/docs/components/text-26","page_id":"/docs/components/text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text#sizes","content":"Without `size`, text takes the scope's body tier, or `md` outside any scope. `size` picks a step\non the body ramp and changes only the font size."},"1697":{"id":"/docs/components/text-27","page_id":"/docs/components/text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text#emphasis","content":"`emphasis` selects a feedback color and changes nothing else. Without it, text inherits the\nsurrounding color."},"1698":{"id":"/docs/components/text-28","page_id":"/docs/components/text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text#detail","content":"`Detail` is supporting copy, such as captions and metadata, on the detail ramp. It keeps the\nsurrounding color; add `emphasis=\"passive\"` to mute it."},"1699":{"id":"/docs/components/text-area","page_id":"/docs/components/text-area","type":"page","content":"TextArea","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-area"},"1700":{"id":"/docs/components/text-area-0","page_id":"/docs/components/text-area","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-area","content":"Multiline text control for use inside a field."},"1701":{"id":"/docs/components/text-area-1","page_id":"/docs/components/text-area","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-area#installation","content":"Installation"},"1702":{"id":"/docs/components/text-area-2","page_id":"/docs/components/text-area","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-area#examples","content":"Examples"},"1703":{"id":"/docs/components/text-area-3","page_id":"/docs/components/text-area","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-area#default","content":"Default"},"1704":{"id":"/docs/components/text-area-4","page_id":"/docs/components/text-area","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-area#props","content":"Props"},"1705":{"id":"/docs/components/text-area-5","page_id":"/docs/components/text-area","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-area#textarea","content":"TextArea"},"1706":{"id":"/docs/components/text-area-6","page_id":"/docs/components/text-area","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-area","content":"`TextArea` is the multiline control inside a field, not a field on its own. Prefer `TextField` as the parent; see that component for fuller examples."},"1707":{"id":"/docs/components/text-area-7","page_id":"/docs/components/text-area","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-area#default","content":"TextArea inside TextField."},"1708":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"page","content":"TextField","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field"},"1709":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-0","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field","content":"TextField is a composed single-line or multiline text input. Use it in forms for short answers (email, search, name) or longer content (comments)."},"1710":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-1","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#features","content":"Features"},"1711":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-2","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#installation","content":"Installation"},"1712":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-3","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#examples","content":"Examples"},"1713":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-4","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#default","content":"Default"},"1714":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-5","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#controlled","content":"Controlled"},"1715":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-6","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#invalid","content":"Invalid"},"1716":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-7","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#disabled","content":"Disabled"},"1717":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-8","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#adornments","content":"Adornments"},"1718":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-9","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#multiline","content":"Multiline"},"1719":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-10","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#sizes","content":"Sizes"},"1720":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-11","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#controls-and-icons","content":"Controls and icons"},"1721":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-12","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#telephone-field","content":"Telephone Field"},"1722":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-13","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#blocks","content":"Blocks"},"1723":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-14","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#props","content":"Props"},"1724":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-15","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#textfield","content":"TextField"},"1725":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-16","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#features","content":"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, `Input` or `TextArea`, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Omitting `Group` leaves the control as a direct field child with box chrome. Use an explicit `Group` for controls or adornments"},"1726":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-17","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#features","content":"**Adornments**: Fixed text or icons before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`) are composed inside `Group`, positioned by source order"},"1727":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-18","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#features","content":"**Controls**: A `Button slot=\"control\"` beside the input is an interactive affix; it picks up field chrome from context"},"1728":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-19","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#features","content":"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"},"1729":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-20","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#features","content":"**Multiline**: Compose a `TextArea` instead of an `Input` for multiline entry"},"1730":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-21","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#features","content":"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"},"1731":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-22","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#features","content":"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, description, error, and composed controls; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope. An explicit `size` on a part still wins for that part"},"1732":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-23","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#default","content":"Minimal usage: a `Label` and an `Input`."},"1733":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-24","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#controlled","content":"Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state."},"1734":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-25","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#invalid","content":"Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` for validation feedback."},"1735":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-26","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#disabled","content":"Use `isDisabled` to prevent input."},"1736":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-27","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#adornments","content":"Fixed text before and after the input, such as currency. Leading and trailing content is\ncomposed inside the `Group` and its position comes from source order."},"1737":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-28","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#multiline","content":"Compose a `TextArea` instead of an `Input` for multiline entry."},"1738":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-29","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#sizes","content":"`size` sets the label, input, description, and any control composed inside. Without it, the\nfield follows the surrounding size scope."},"1739":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-30","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#controls-and-icons","content":"Put a control or an icon beside the input. A `Button slot=\"control\"` is an\ninteractive affix; static content is wrapped in a `Flex as=\"span\"` to center it and give it a gutter."},"1740":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-31","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#telephone-field","content":"Compose a telephone number input paired with a country-code select."},"1741":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-32","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#blocks","content":"sign-in-form"},"1742":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"page","content":"TextLockup","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup"},"1743":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-0","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup","content":"TextLockup stacks an eyebrow, title, and body text as one coordinated type group across six sizes."},"1744":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-1","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#features","content":"Features"},"1745":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-2","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#installation","content":"Installation"},"1746":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-3","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#examples","content":"Examples"},"1747":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-4","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#default","content":"Default"},"1748":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-5","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#sizes","content":"Sizes"},"1749":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-6","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#tag-eyebrow","content":"Tag Eyebrow"},"1750":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-7","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#alignment","content":"Alignment"},"1751":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-8","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#legible-lines","content":"Legible Lines"},"1752":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-9","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#with-actions","content":"With Actions"},"1753":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-10","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#corner-actions","content":"Corner Actions"},"1754":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-11","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#customization","content":"Customization"},"1755":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-12","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"1756":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-13","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"1757":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-14","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#props","content":"Props"},"1758":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-15","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#textlockup","content":"TextLockup"},"1759":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-16","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#features","content":"Six coordinated sizes, from a `2xl` page title down to `xs`"},"1760":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-17","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#features","content":"An eyebrow that takes plain text or a `Tag`, sized to match the lockup"},"1761":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-18","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#features","content":"Slotted parts, so nested components keep their own type"},"1762":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-19","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#features","content":"Any heading level, chosen independently of the visual size"},"1763":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-20","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#features","content":"Start or center alignment"},"1764":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-21","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#features","content":"A legible line-length clamp, on by default"},"1765":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-22","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#default","content":"A lockup stacks an optional eyebrow, a title and body text as one coordinated type\ngroup. You supply the parts, so the title can be any heading level and the body any\nnumber of paragraphs; `size` sets the tier for all of them at once."},"1766":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-23","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#sizes","content":"`size` sets every part, each on its own role ramp. Without it, the lockup follows the size\nscope."},"1767":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-24","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#tag-eyebrow","content":"The eyebrow takes either plain text or a `Tag`. Both use `slot=\"eyebrow\"`, so the two\nforms swap freely, and the lockup pairs the tag's `size` with its own."},"1768":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-25","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#alignment","content":"`align` centers the parts as well as the text, so a `Tag` eyebrow stays centered too."},"1769":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-26","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#legible-lines","content":"The text parts are constrained to a comfortable line length by default. Set\n`legibleLines={false}` to let them run the full width of their container, which suits a\nlockup already inside a narrow column. Both lockups below share one wide container, so the\nclamp is what makes the first one narrower."},"1770":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-27","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#with-actions","content":"Because you compose the parts, anything else can sit alongside them — a call to action\nhere. Controls keep their own type: the buttons are unaffected by the lockup's `size`."},"1771":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-28","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#corner-actions","content":"An article introduction with a menu to mark it as read. Put CornerActions before Heading\ninside Header so the title wraps around the menu button."},"1772":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-29","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#customization","content":"`TextLockup` positions and type-sets its parts; you supply them. That means anything else can\nsit alongside them — a call to action, a second paragraph, an image — without the component\ngrowing a prop for it."},"1773":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-30","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#customization","content":"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Unslotted text follows\nthe lockup's tier too: a bare `Heading` takes the title tier and a bare `Text` the body tier."},"1774":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-31","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#customization","content":"**The eyebrow is `slot=\"eyebrow\"`**, on either a `Text` or a `Tag`. The two forms swap\nfreely, and a `Tag` is sized to pair with the lockup."},"1775":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-32","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#customization","content":"**The title is `<Heading slot=\"title\">`.** Pick the level from the document outline, not the\nvisual size: `size` handles the visuals, so `level={1}` in an `xs` lockup is perfectly valid."},"1776":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-33","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#customization","content":"**The body is `<Text slot=\"body\">`**, once or as many times as the copy needs."},"1777":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-34","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#customization","content":"**An explicit prop on a child always wins** over what the lockup supplies. Pass\n`<Tag slot=\"eyebrow\" size=\"sm\">` to break the pairing, for instance."},"1778":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-35","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#customization","content":"**Controls keep the scale size.** A `Button` inside a lockup follows the surrounding\n`SizeProvider` or its own `size` prop, never the lockup's tier."},"1779":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-36","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#customization","content":"**`size` is the tier.** The eyebrow reads it on the `detail` ramp, the title on `heading`, and\nthe body on `body`, so there is no table to memorize. Without `size`, the lockup follows the\nsurrounding size scope. A tier is the same at every container width."},"1780":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-37","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#customization","content":"Pass `className` to extend the styles, or select on `[data-align]`."},"1781":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-38","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#accessibility","content":"The title carries the heading semantics. Choose `level` so the page outline stays correct\nrather than to achieve a size."},"1782":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-39","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#accessibility","content":"Slots resolve against the lockup, so `slot=\"title\"` names the lockup's title, not an outer\ncontainer's. Inside a\n`Modal`, `Drawer` or `Popover`, give the dialog its own `<Heading slot=\"title\">` as a direct\nchild for the accessible name, and use the lockup for the body."},"1783":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-40","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#accessibility","content":"The eyebrow is decorative in most designs. If it carries meaning, make sure the title still\nreads sensibly on its own, since screen reader users often navigate by heading."},"1784":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-41","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#best-practices","content":"Use one `2xl` lockup per page at most — it is the page title."},"1785":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-42","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#best-practices","content":"Keep `legibleLines` on for running prose. Turn it off only when the lockup already sits in a\nnarrow column, where the clamp does nothing but complicate the layout."},"1786":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-43","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#best-practices","content":"Prefer a `Tag` eyebrow for status or category, and plain text for a kicker or section label."},"1787":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-44","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#best-practices","content":"Reach for `MetricsLockup` instead when the emphasis is a single number rather than prose."},"1788":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-45","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#props","content":"Place the title directly inside `TextLockup` when there are no corner actions. The eyebrow can\nbe `Text` or `Tag` and comes before the title."},"1789":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-46","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#props","content":"Wrap the title in `Header` when using `CornerActions`."},"1790":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"page","content":"ToggleButton","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button"},"1791":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-0","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button","content":"Accessible toggle button component for grouped contextual actions with single or multiple selection, keyboard navigation, and RTL-aware layouts."},"1792":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-1","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#installation","content":"Installation"},"1793":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-2","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#examples","content":"Examples"},"1794":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-3","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#default","content":"Default"},"1795":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-4","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#multiple-selection","content":"Multiple Selection"},"1796":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-5","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#controlled","content":"Controlled"},"1797":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-6","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#disabled-states","content":"Disabled States"},"1798":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-7","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#sizes","content":"Sizes"},"1799":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-8","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#icon--text","content":"Icon + Text"},"1800":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-9","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#icon-only","content":"Icon Only"},"1801":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-10","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#with-dropdown","content":"With Dropdown"},"1802":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-11","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#rtl-direction","content":"RTL Direction"},"1803":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-12","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#customization","content":"Customization"},"1804":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-13","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#data-attributes","content":"Data Attributes"},"1805":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-14","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#component-customization","content":"Component Customization"},"1806":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-15","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"1807":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-16","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"Keyboard Navigation"},"1808":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-17","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#aria-support","content":"ARIA Support"},"1809":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-18","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#troubleshooting","content":"Troubleshooting"},"1810":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-19","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#selection-not-updating","content":"Selection Not Updating"},"1811":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-20","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#styling-overrides-not-applying","content":"Styling Overrides Not Applying"},"1812":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-21","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation-not-working","content":"Keyboard Navigation Not Working"},"1813":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-22","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"1814":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-23","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"When to Use"},"1815":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-24","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keep-variants-consistent","content":"Keep Variants Consistent"},"1816":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-25","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#balance-label-lengths","content":"Balance Label Lengths"},"1817":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-26","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#alignment","content":"Alignment"},"1818":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-27","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#label-guidelines","content":"Label Guidelines"},"1819":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-28","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#icon-only-items","content":"Icon-Only Items"},"1820":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-29","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#props","content":"Props"},"1821":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-30","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#togglebuttongroup","content":"ToggleButtonGroup"},"1822":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-31","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#togglebutton","content":"ToggleButton"},"1823":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-32","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#default","content":"A `ToggleButton` toggles between selected and unselected. Wrap multiple inside a `ToggleButtonGroup` to link them with shared selection and keyboard navigation."},"1824":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-33","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#multiple-selection","content":"Use `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow more than one item to be active at a time."},"1825":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-34","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#controlled","content":"Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` to control selection from parent state."},"1826":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-35","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#disabled-states","content":"Disable the entire group with `isDisabled` on the container, or disable individual items with `isDisabled` on specific `ToggleButton` elements."},"1827":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-36","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#sizes","content":"Two sizes are available: `sm` and `md` (default)."},"1828":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-37","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#icon--text","content":"Items can include an `Icon` alongside text for added visual context."},"1829":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-38","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#icon-only","content":"For compact layouts, items can contain only icons. Always provide an `aria-label` on each icon-only item."},"1830":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-39","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#with-dropdown","content":"Wrap a `ToggleButton` in a `MenuTrigger` to add sub-options to a group item."},"1831":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-40","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#rtl-direction","content":"The group follows the document's layout direction, detected automatically from the browser locale."},"1832":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-41","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#data-attributes","content":"Components automatically add data attributes for styling different states:"},"1833":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-42","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#data-attributes","content":"**ToggleButtonGroup Container:** `data-size`"},"1834":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-43","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#data-attributes","content":"**ToggleButton Item:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"},"1835":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-44","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#component-customization","content":"Individual components can be styled by passing `className` props:"},"1836":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-45","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"Key"},"1837":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-46","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"Action"},"1838":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-47","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Tab**"},"1839":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-48","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"Moves focus to/from the button group (single tab stop)"},"1840":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-49","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Arrow Left / Right**"},"1841":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-50","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"Move focus between items (RAC automatically reverses in RTL)"},"1842":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-51","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Space / Enter**"},"1843":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-52","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"Toggle the focused item"},"1844":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-53","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Home**"},"1845":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-54","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"Move focus to the first item"},"1846":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-55","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"**End**"},"1847":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-56","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"Move focus to the last item"},"1848":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-57","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#aria-support","content":"`selectionMode=\"single\"` → `role=\"radiogroup\"` on container, `role=\"radio\"` + `aria-checked` per item"},"1849":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-58","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#aria-support","content":"`selectionMode=\"multiple\"` → `role=\"toolbar\"` on container, `role=\"button\"` + `aria-pressed` per item"},"1850":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-59","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#aria-support","content":"`aria-label` (or `aria-labelledby`) is required on the group container"},"1851":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-60","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#aria-support","content":"Icon-only items require `aria-label` on each `ToggleButton`"},"1852":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-61","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"✅ For grouped contextual actions — two or more closely related actions that belong together (e.g. Bold / Italic / Underline, Align Left / Center / Right)"},"1853":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-62","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"✅ For compact action grouping — related actions in space-constrained layouts (e.g. Undo / Redo, Zoom In / Out / Reset)"},"1854":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-63","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"✅ For multi-select scenarios — when users need to select multiple options simultaneously"},"1855":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-64","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"❌ For unrelated actions that perform disconnected tasks without shared context"},"1856":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-65","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"❌ For more than 5 choices — cognitive overload; consider a **Select** instead"},"1857":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-66","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"❌ When actions require strong visual distinction (e.g. Save vs. Delete)"},"1858":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-67","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"❌ When selecting an option leads to a different page or workflow — use navigation instead"},"1859":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-68","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"❌ For mutually exclusive content views (e.g. Monthly / Yearly) — use **SegmentedController** instead"},"1860":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-69","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keep-variants-consistent","content":"Avoid mixing different content types (text-only, icon-only, icon+text) within the same group. Mixing styles creates visual noise and makes the set feel fragmented rather than unified."},"1861":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-70","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#balance-label-lengths","content":"Keep button labels of similar length. Large differences in text length cause irregular button widths and make the group appear uneven. Prefer short, concise wording."},"1862":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-71","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#alignment","content":"Align the group to reflect its relationship to surrounding content:"},"1863":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-72","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#alignment","content":"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."},"1864":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-73","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#alignment","content":"**Center** — when the group acts as a prominent toggle affecting an entire section or page."},"1865":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-74","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#alignment","content":"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (e.g. grid/list view toggle)."},"1866":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-75","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#label-guidelines","content":"Use **title case**: capitalize the first letter of each word, except short prepositions."},"1867":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-76","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#label-guidelines","content":"Keep labels to one or two words. Omit articles (a, an, the) and filler words."},"1868":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-77","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#label-guidelines","content":"Prefer action-focused or descriptive language that communicates the option instantly."},"1869":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-78","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#icon-only-items","content":"Use icon-only items only when the icon's meaning is universally recognized. Always provide an `aria-label` on each icon-only `ToggleButton`:"},"1870":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"page","content":"Tooltip","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip"},"1871":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-0","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip","content":"The Tooltip component displays a description of an element on hover or focus."},"1872":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-1","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#features","content":"Features"},"1873":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-2","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#installation","content":"Installation"},"1874":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-3","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#examples","content":"Examples"},"1875":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-4","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#default","content":"Default"},"1876":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-5","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#custom-anchor","content":"Custom Anchor"},"1877":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-6","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#customization","content":"Customization"},"1878":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-7","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"1879":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-8","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#keyboard","content":"Keyboard"},"1880":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-9","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#aria","content":"ARIA"},"1881":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-10","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"1882":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-11","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#props","content":"Props"},"1883":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-12","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#tooltip","content":"Tooltip"},"1884":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-13","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#tooltiptrigger","content":"TooltipTrigger"},"1885":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-14","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip","content":"Tooltips appear after a short delay when hovering, and immediately when the element receives focus.\nOnce a tooltip has been shown, subsequent tooltips appear without delay."},"1886":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-15","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip","content":"`TooltipTrigger` wraps a focusable element and a `<Tooltip>`, handling hover/focus state and positioning automatically."},"1887":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-16","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#features","content":"`overlay` elevation panel positioned relative to its trigger, with an optional arrow"},"1888":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-17","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#features","content":"Flips and shifts to stay in the viewport"},"1889":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-18","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#features","content":"Configurable open and close delays"},"1890":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-19","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#default","content":"Use it with `TooltipTrigger`, which wraps both the tooltip content and a focusable element such as a `Button`. The tooltip appears on hover and focus."},"1891":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-20","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#custom-anchor","content":"To position a tooltip relative to a different focusable element, use the `triggerRef` prop. `TooltipTrigger` still handles showing and hiding on hover and focus."},"1892":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-21","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#customization","content":"`className` and `style` apply to the tooltip panel."},"1893":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-22","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#keyboard","content":"Key"},"1894":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-23","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#keyboard","content":"Action"},"1895":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-24","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#keyboard","content":"`Tab`"},"1896":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-25","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#keyboard","content":"Moves focus to the focusable element and shows the tooltip"},"1897":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-26","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#keyboard","content":"`Escape`"},"1898":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-27","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#keyboard","content":"Closes the tooltip"},"1899":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-28","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#aria","content":"The tooltip uses `role=\"tooltip\"` and is associated with its focusable element via `aria-describedby`"},"1900":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-29","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#best-practices","content":"Keep tooltip content short and informative."},"1901":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-30","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#best-practices","content":"Tooltips are not shown on touch screen interactions. Ensure your UI is usable without tooltips."},"1902":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-31","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#best-practices","content":"Do not place interactive content inside tooltips. Use a `Popover` instead."},"1903":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"page","content":"Bar Chart","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components","Chart"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart"},"1904":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-0","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","content":"A flexible, accessible, and design-aligned data visualization solution for displaying single or multi-series bar charts."},"1905":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-1","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"Features"},"1906":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-2","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#installation","content":"Installation"},"1907":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-3","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#examples","content":"Examples"},"1908":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-4","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#default","content":"Default"},"1909":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-5","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#multi-series","content":"Multi-series"},"1910":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-6","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#horizontal-single-series","content":"Horizontal single series"},"1911":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-7","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#horizontal-multi-series","content":"Horizontal multi-series"},"1912":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-8","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#custom-domain","content":"Custom domain"},"1913":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/b