ngle\"` → `role=\"radiogroup\"` on container, `role=\"radio\"` + `aria-checked` per item"],[593,"`shouldCloseOnSelect={false}` on the picker keeps either presentation open after a selection."],[912,"`size` controls item density. Shown here as two standalone menus so both\nsizes are visible at once; in practice you set `size` on the `Menu` inside a\n`MenuTrigger`."],[1688,"`size` picks a step on the component's own ramp (`xs` to `2xl`) and changes only the font size."],[1766,"`size` sets every part, each on its own role ramp. Without it, the lockup follows the size\nscope."],[1038,"`size` sets the label, input, and steppers. Without it, the field follows the surrounding size\nscope."],[1738,"`size` sets the label, input, description, and any control composed inside. Without it, the\nfield follows the surrounding size scope."],[586,"`size` sets the label, trigger, and calendar. Without it, the picker follows the surrounding\nsize scope."],[996,"`size` sets the modal's text, controls, and spacing. Without it, the modal follows the size\nscope around its trigger."],[672,"`slot=\"title\"` inside a `Modal` or `Dialog` sets the accessible name, and takes the overlay's\ntitle tier, one step above the heading tier."],[2148,"`sm` - Small spacing"],[1466,"`sm`, `md`, or `lg` for the adopted components inside (listed below): their text, controls, and\ndefault spacing."],[95,"`Space` / `Enter`"],[1574,"`Space` toggles the switch when it has focus"],[1188,"`status` is independent of timeline and only controls the status icon and (for `error`) the accent bar color."],[93,"`Tab`"],[534,"`Tab`"],[617,"`Tab`"],[846,"`Tab`"],[1000,"`Tab`"],[1895,"`Tab`"],[58,"`Tab` / `Shift + Tab`"],[487,"`Tab` / `Shift + Tab`"],[1621,"`Tab`: `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, and `data-disabled`."],[1618,"`TabList` must be rendered inside `Tabs` and must provide `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`. Give each `Tab` and its corresponding `TabPanel` the same `id`; React